    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I&#39;ve tried not to fix this two variances. But the program came to an error.</div><br><br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Warning</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> message</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lavaan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lavaan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> model6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lv </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> F</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">type </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;sem&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span></div></code></div></div>"
